; ANIMS.GRX: animations in GRAPHER
; ANIM name [n] plays name.ANI n times (0 or
; nothing: until a key; ESC stops when interpreted)
; during an animation, left and right
; arrows: move the tearing line
; (timing against the screen)
; usage: GRAPHER ANIMS (or /A then ASM)
HIRES
ANIM CUBE 3
GTEXT 2 188 12 frames, a quarter turn
DELAY 100
ANIM BALL 2
GTEXT 2 188 Only the ball changes
DELAY 100
FOR I 1 3
ANIM SHIP 1
NEXT
GTEXT 2 188 End: a key
WAIT
